      "notes": "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks. Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer. Native shared displayCAD accounts for3/1116 source components. S3 electronic assembly is explicitly omitted; replacementS31 PCB is markedUNKNOWN. Box SKU116.3×79×18mm packaging is documented but model shows only shared display/PCB envelope. The box and optional battery are not reconstructed yet. Viewing aperture95.54×54.36mm and800×480 pixelaspect conflict; image is letterboxed inside the documented aperture, not stretched. Optical active area calibration unresolved. BOOT/LED/ports are exposed through product controls and logs; locations are not fabricated on this partial mechanical model."
