  "collectionNotes": [
    "已实现受真实 RGB/AXI-GDMA、完整 800×480 RGB565、引脚路由与 GPIO47 背光门控约束的显示子集；S31 LEDC 背光波形尚未实现。",
    "GT911 单触点报告/确认、GPIO46 复位与 INT2 地址选择、GPIO61 BOOT、GPIO55 LED、PCF85063 和 QMI8658C 数字寄存器子集；原厂多点触摸、ES8389 音频、电池、电源、CAN-FD、RS485、USB Host 和无线未验收。",
    "TF 卡具有 GPIO56 低有效电源门控与物理 SDMMC 引脚；默认 64 MiB FAT32 不表示原厂文件系统已通过。",
    "官方同一型号出厂恢复镜像适用于三种包装 SKU；已核对完整镜像的芯片、分区、checksum/SHA 与容量，原厂启动和实机未验证。",
    "按 N16R16 设置 16 MiB Flash/PSRAM；NOR/PLL/模拟输入沿用明确的名义模型假设，没有借用其他设备的实测 eFuse。",
    "UIFlow1、UIFlow2、小智：本轮官方型号 README/资源页未列出精确 S31-Touch-LCD-4.3C 目标镜像；上游目标专项核验仍未知，不使用同名 S3 固件替代。",
    "3D 来源：official-cad-partial；生产Three加载器/原生尺寸/屏幕射线/展开复位已检验；部分结构和光学尺寸有明确限制，未宣称浏览器WebGL或实物装配通过。",
    "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks.",
    "Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer.",
    "Native shared displayCAD accounts for3/1116 source components. S3 electronic assembly is explicitly omitted; replacementS31 PCB is markedUNKNOWN.",
    "Box SKU116.3×79×18mm packaging is documented but model shows only shared display/PCB envelope. The box and optional battery are not reconstructed yet.",
    "Viewing aperture95.54×54.36mm and800×480 pixelaspect conflict; image is letterboxed inside the documented aperture, not stretched. Optical active area calibration unresolved.",
    "BOOT/LED/ports are exposed through product controls and logs; locations are not fabricated on this partial mechanical model."
  ]
}
